      "writtenOn": "2023-01-19T15:59:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks the suggestion of store the hash in zip header, it looks better than creating a separate manifest file. After investigation, I prefer to store it in the `comment` field rather than `extra` filed. The comment field is in String type and it is easy to extra the SHA256 value with regex, while `extra` is a byte array and is hard to separate the SHA256 value with existing data stored in the field. What do you think?\n\nAnd I tried merge_zips, it seems the `comment` information is lost after running merge_zips, though I feel that shouldn\u0027t be hard to keep it. It would be great if you have more information about merge_zips.",
      "parentUuid": "6047cbf5_f9fe73c3",
